        colorBannerRow:SetCenteredVertically(true)
        // On a phone (design A), the picture on the left and the words
        // beside it, taking the rest of the row: the words come first in
        // the page, so the row is shown reversed. From a medium screen, the
        // words first and the picture after them, centered.
